{"unit_id":"tag:00YT:statement","translation":"假设函子（functor）<MATH_0001> 满足命题 <REF_0001> 的假设，因而给出位点（sites）的态射（morphism）<MATH_0002>。此时，逆像（pullback）函子（functor）<MATH_0003>（分别地<SPACE_0001><MATH_0004>）及正像（pushforward）函子（functor）<MATH_0005>（分别地 <MATH_0006>）延拓为代数结构（algebraic structures）的层（sheaves）（分别地<SPACE_0002>预层（presheaves））的范畴（categories）上的一对伴随（adjoint）函子（functors）。此外，这些函子（functors）与取底层集合（sets）的层（sheaf）（分别地<SPACE_0003>预层（presheaf））的操作可交换（commute）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"逆像"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"pushforward","target_term":"正像"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"algebraic structures","target_term":"代数结构"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"commute","target_term":"可交换"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"逆像","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"pushforward","target_term":"正像","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic structures","target_term":"代数结构","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"categories","target_term":"范畴","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"functors