{"unit_id":"tag:00YV:statement","translation":"<LOCKED_0001>\n设 <MATH_0001>、<MATH_0002> 是位点（sites）。设 <MATH_0003> 是拓扑斯态射（morphism of topoi），从 <MATH_0004> 出发。上述方法在代数结构（algebraic structures）的层（sheaves）上给出一对伴随（adjoint）函子（functors）<MATH_0005>，与取底层集合（sets）的层（sheaves）的操作相容，适用于以下代数结构（algebraic structures）类型：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> 带点（pointed）集合（sets），\n<STRUCT_0003> 阿贝尔群（abelian groups），\n<STRUCT_0004> 群（groups），\n<STRUCT_0005> 幺半群（monoids），\n<STRUCT_0006> 环（rings），\n<STRUCT_0007> 固定环（ring）上的模（modules），以及\n<STRUCT_0008> 固定域（field）上的李（lie）代数（algebras）。\n<STRUCT_0009>\n此外，在这些情形的每一种中，上面标记为 (<MATH_0006>)、(<MATH_0007>)、(<MATH_0008>)、(<MATH_0009>)、(<MATH_0010>) 和 (<MATH_0011>) 的结果均成立。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"morphism of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic structures","target_term":"代数结构"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随"},{"source_term":"functors","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"algebraic structures","target_term":"代数结构"},{"source_term":"pointed","target_term":"带点"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"abelian groups","target_term":"阿贝尔群"},{"source_term":"groups","target_term":"群"},{"source_term":"monoids","target_term":"幺半群"},{"source_term":"rings","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"ring","target_term":"环"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"field","target_term":"域"},{"source_term":"lie","target_term":"李"},{"source_term":"algebras","target_term":"代数"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"morphism of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic structures","target_term":"代数结构","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随","context":"