{"unit_id":"tag:06UM:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n位点（site）<MATH_0001> 有时没有终对象（final object）。此时，我们如下定义整体截面（global section）函子（functor）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"final object","target_term":"终对象"},{"source_term":"global section","target_term":"整体截面"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"final object","target_term":"终对象","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"global section","target_term":"整体截面","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06UN:statement","translation":"<TEXTITOPEN_0001>整体截面（global sections）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>，对于集合（sets）的预层（presheaf）<MATH_0001>（定义于位点（site）<MATH_0002> 上），定义为集合（set）\n<MATH_0003>\n其中 <MATH_0004> 是预层（presheaves）的范畴（category）（定义于 <MATH_0005> 上）中的终对象（final object），即将每个对象（object）对应到单元素集（singleton）的预层（presheaf）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"global sections","target_term":"整体截面"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"final object","target_term":"终对象"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"singleton","target_term":"单元素集"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"global sections","target_term":"整体截面","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"sets","target_term":"集合","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"presheaf","target_term":"预层","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"set","target_term":"集合","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"presheaves","target_term":"预层","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"final object","target_term":"终对象","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"singleton","target_term":"单元素集","context":"待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:06UM:prose-0002","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n当然，同一定义也适用于层（sheaves）。下面给出一种计算整体截面（global sections）的方法。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"global sections","target_term":"整体截面"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"global sections","target_term":"整体截面","context":"待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0792:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 是位点（site）。设 <MATH_0002> 是 <MATH_0003> 的对象（objects），使得\n<MATH_0004>\n是 <MATH_0005> 中的余等化子（coequalizer）。则 <MATH_0006> 是 <MATH_0007> 的等化子（equalizer）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"coequalizer","target_term":"余等化子"},{"source_term":"equalizer","target_term":"等化子"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"site","target_term":"位点","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"objects","target_term":"对象","context":"来源将显示的 a,b 态射称为 objects；忠实保留，待决。"},{"source_term":"coequalizer","target_term":"余等化子","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"equalizer","target_term":"等化子","context":"待决。"}],"notes":["源文 Let a,b:V→U be objects 使用 objects 描述显示的态射；按文字保留，不更改公式或来源。"]}
