{"unit_id":"tag:06UM:prose-0003","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n现在，设 <MATH_0001> 是拓扑斯态射（morphism of topoi）。则对任意层（sheaf）<MATH_0002>（定义于 <MATH_0003> 上），有逆像（pullback）映射（map）\n<MATH_0004>\n具体地，由于 <MATH_0005> 正合（exact），它将 <MATH_0006> 变为 <MATH_0007>。因此，整体截面（global section）<MATH_0008>（属于 <MATH_0009>，定义于 <MATH_0010> 上）是层（sheaves）的映射（map）<MATH_0011>，可以取逆像为 <MATH_0012>。\n\n<STRUCT_0002><STRUCT_0003>\n考虑一对层（sheaves）<MATH_0013>、<MATH_0014>，分别定义于 <MATH_0015>、<MATH_0016> 上，并配备映射（map）<MATH_0017>，可以对此稍作推广。此时，将上述构造与显然的映射（map）\n<MATH_0018>\n复合，得到映射（map）\n<MATH_0019>\n这个映射（map）有时也称为逆像（pullback）映射（map）。\n\n<STRUCT_0004><STRUCT_0005>\n一种稍为更一般且经常自然出现的构造如下。假设有拓扑斯态射（morphisms of topoi）的交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0020>\n再假设有层（sheaf）<MATH_0021>（定义于 <MATH_0022> 上）。则有 <TEXTITOPEN_0001>逆像（pullback）映射（map）<TEXTITCLOSE_0001>\n<MATH_0023>\n具体地，它就是由等同 <MATH_0024> 以及将 <MATH_0025> 应用于典范映射（canonical map）<MATH_0026> 而得到的映射（map）。若 <MATH_0027> 是恒等，则此整体截面（global sections）上的映射（map）与上面的逆像（pullback）映射（map）一致。\n\n<STRUCT_0006><STRUCT_0007>\n在上一段的情形中，假设有一对层（sheaves）<MATH_0028>、<MATH_0029>，分别定义于 <MATH_0030>、<MATH_0031> 上，并配备映射（map）<MATH_0032>，则将上面的逆像（pullback）映射（map）与将 <MATH_0033> 应用于\n<MATH_0034>\n所得的映射复合，得到映射（map）\n<MATH_0035>\n限制到 <MATH_0036> 的一个对象（object）上的截面（sections），便恢复上面讨论的整体截面（global sections）上的“逆像（pullback）映射（map）”（适当选择位点（sites））。\n\n<STRUCT_0008><STRUCT_0009>\n一种更一般的情形是，有拓扑斯（topoi）的交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0037>\n以及层（sheaf）<MATH_0038>（定义于 <MATH_0039> 上）。则有\n<TEXTITOPEN_0002>基变换（base change）映射（map）<TEXTITCLOSE_0002>\n<MATH_0040>\n具体地，这个映射（map）伴随（adjoint）于映射（map）\n<MATH_0041>\n它就是刚刚描述的逆像（pullback）映射（map）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphism of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"逆像"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"global section","target_term":"整体截面"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"逆像"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"morphisms of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"逆像"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"global sections","target_term":"整体截面"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"逆像"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"逆像"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象"},{"source_term":"sections","target_term":"截面"},{"source_term":"global sections","target_term":"整体截面"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"逆像"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"逆像"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphism of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"sheaf","target_term":"层","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"pullback","target_term":"逆像","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"global section","target_term":"整体截面","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"sheaves","target_term":"层","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"morphisms of topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯态射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"canonical map","target_term":"典范映射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"global sections","target_term":"整体截面","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"object","target_term":"对象","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"sections","target_term":"截面","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"sites","target_term":"位点","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"adjoint","target_term":"伴随","context":"待决。"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0F6X:statement","translation":"考虑交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0001>\n其中各项为拓扑斯（topoi）。则两个方形的基变换（base change）映射（maps）的复合给出外部矩形的基变换（base change）映射（map）。更精确地，复合（composition）\n<MATH_0002>\n是该矩形的基变换（base change）映射（map）。我们省略验证。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"topoi","target_term":"拓扑斯","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合","context":"待决。"}],"notes":["源文省略验证；译文保留，未补证明。"]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0F6Y:statement","translation":"考虑交换图（commutative diagram）\n<MATH_0001>\n其中各项为环化拓扑斯（ringed topoi）。则两个方形的基变换（base change）映射（maps）的复合给出外部矩形的基变换（base change）映射（map）。更精确地，复合（composition）\n<MATH_0002>\n是该矩形的基变换（base change）映射（map）。我们省略验证。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"环化拓扑斯"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"commutative diagram","target_term":"交换图","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"ringed topoi","target_term":"环化拓扑斯","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"base change","target_term":"基变换","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"待决。"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合","context":"待决。"}],"notes":["源文省略验证；译文保留，未补证明。"]}
